      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 34-year old man presented with headaches. Computed tomography scanning revealed an enhancing subdural mass extending from the skull base to the convexity, thought to represent an en-plaque meningioma. Pathologic study revealed extraaxial subdural granulomatous inflammation consistent with neurosarcoidosis."},
